    <string name="about">Settings file: %1$s
One wallpaper: name it exactly wallpaper.jpg (or .png) and put it in that folder
Several wallpapers: put them in %2$s/ with any names, and pick a rotation
Then pick Background › Image file or Adaptive wallpaper tint. No permission is needed
Adaptive wallpaper tint shows graphite until you add a wallpaper
No internet permission. No tracking, no ads, no accounts.</string>

